  "description": "Lim Bonha, the youngest daughter of the Y Corp family, has it all—looks, wealth, and charm. But for the past 14 years, she’s been hopelessly in love with her first crush, Lee Eunho. Now, as a confident and stunning young woman, Bonha is determined to put an end to her one-sided love. She’s ready to make him hers, no matter what. The only problem? Eunho still sees her as the little girl from 14 years ago. But for this relentless heiress, that’s just a minor obstacle.\n\n*\"Would you marry me, Eunho? And just so you know, the only acceptable answer is Yes!\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
